2026-07-27T09:14:48.2921825Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:14:48.2922317Z i /tmp/RtmpTbZg39/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:14:48.2922672Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:14:48.2923077Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:14:48.2923432Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:14:48.2923964Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:14:48.2924747Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:14:48.2925643Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
